  "id": 8860456321223,
  "title": "Personalized Cozy Room Sophia Bookworm Reading Girl Blanket - Book",
  "handle": "personalized-cozy-room-sophia-bookworm-reading-girl-blanket-book",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in comfort with our customizable Jeminise blanket, designed especially for book lovers. This thoughtful and personal blanket celebrates your passion for reading, making it a unique addition to any cozy nook or a cherished gift for a fellow bibliophile.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Gift for Book Lovers:</strong> A personal and cherished item that highlights a love for reading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize with details like skin color, hairstyle, and name to create a one-of-a-kind blanket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Perfect Gift Idea:</strong> Ideal for birthdays, Christmas, or as a heartfelt surprise for readers.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort and Style:</strong> A beautifully designed, personalized blanket that adds warmth and style to any reading space.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from soft Polyester fabric with a Polyester fill material.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This blanket is machine washable for convenient cleaning.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>40x30 inches, 50x40 inches, 60x50 inches, 80x60 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
